        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hek 11:6-8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kisha Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Moyo wa Farao umekuwa mgumu. Anakataa kuwaacha Waisraeli waondoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, nenda ukakutane naye kesho asubuhi, wakati anapokwenda mtoni Nili. Mngojee kando ya mto. Chukua mkononi mwako ile fimbo iliyogeuka kuwa nyoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha mwambie hivi, Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Waebrania, amenituma kwako, naye asema hivi, ‘Waache watu wangu waende zao ili wanitumikie jangwani, lakini mpaka sasa wewe hupendi kutii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Ufu 16:4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu asema kwamba sasa utamtambua yeye ni nani. Nitayapiga maji ya mto Nili kwa fimbo hii, na maji yote yatageuka kuwa damu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samaki waliomo mtoni Nili watakufa, mto wote utanuka vibaya, na Wamisri watachukia kabisa kunywa maji yake.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
